The Tuya BLE protocol logic in this package (framing, fragmentation, key derivation, the handshake, data-point
encoding and advertisement decoding) is ported from ha_tuya_ble, https://github.com/PlusPlus-ua/ha_tuya_ble
(commit 6037ac5a04ceb23a36d1b88e2303aa1da7fdbe83) and its consolidated fork https://github.com/ha-tuya-ble/ha_tuya_ble
(commit 40899aeff5f1bcb63aca26fba4ee59b76e101681), which are distributed under the following licence.

